      "writtenOn": "2022-12-28T00:08:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No it\u0027s done on purpose.\nThe warning is there to prevent using ASSERT in normal test check.\nThis is not a normal test check as this must never fail.\n\nIf it fail we don\u0027t want to test more and want to abort the test",
