      "writtenOn": "2022-12-28T01:02:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I could have replaced all call to sync_handler with \n```\nASSERT_NO_FATAL_FAILURE(sync_handler)\n```\n\nBut it\u0027s more error prone as one will forget.\nOr putting it in a macro but it\u0027s worst imo",
